 reported in <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:f-1433"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:f-1434">other (expense)</span></span>, net in the company&#8217;s consolidated statements of income (loss).</span></div></ix:nonNumeric><div style="margin-top:6pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Management&#8217;s significant assumption used in the determination of the defined benefit pension plan obligations with respect to the U.S. pension plans, is the discount rate. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfAssumptionsUsedTableTextBlock" id="f-1435" continuedAt="f-1435-1" escape="true">Weighted-average assumptions used to determine net periodic pension expense (income) were as follows:</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><ix:continuation id="f-1435-1" continuedAt="f-1435-2"><div style="margin-top:6pt"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:99.561%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:45.155%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.534%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:7.123%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.534%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:7.123%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.534%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:7.123%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.534%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:7.123%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.534%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:7.123%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.534%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:7.126%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="pa